{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0e49aa9dc5a833d9319","chatId":"663ce3f164b04f3db618bbf248f05d09","sessionId":null,"userId":98331,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"F\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"F\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":19036,"promptTokens":1781,"completionTokens":360,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:20:04"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":5,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00460810680768194,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0e49aa9dc5a833d9318","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482404810,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:20:04","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0e49aa9dc5a833d9318","chatId":"663ce3f164b04f3db618bbf248f05d09","sessionId":null,"userId":98331,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n为了庆祝他搬进新家，小钟主持了乔迁派对并且邀请了他最好的一个朋友，小利。大概下午6点时，小利到达了小钟的家并且进屋时没有脱鞋。见此情景，小钟要求他脱鞋并且给了他一双拖鞋在室内用。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，小钟最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 充满希望 & 好奇\nB) 感激 & 充满希望\nC) 开心 & 好奇\nD) 气恼 & 好奇\nE) 气恼 & 感激\nF) 反对 & 气恼\n\n## 问题 2\n小钟为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 小利进屋不脱鞋，这在他的文化中是不常见的 & 小钟迟到了喜洋洋的新居庆祝会\nB) 小钟迟到了喜洋洋的新居庆祝会 & 小钟没有带新居礼物\nC) 他想穿小钟的鞋子 & 小钟未经通知就出现在他的家里。\nD) 小利进屋不脱鞋，这在他的文化中是不常见的 & 小钟没有带新居礼物\nE) 小钟没有带新居礼物 & 他想穿小钟的鞋子\nF) 小利进屋不脱鞋，这在他的文化中是不常见的 & 尽管他提出要换鞋，小利还是拒绝了","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":4,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00460810680768194,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0e49aa9dc5a833d9319","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482404807,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:20:04","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"7f0102d10c3644fa8345baf463b2c13d"}